Subject: Connect UAPI6 builtin to the matching kernel-only KPM bridge ABI v2

Target: SukiSU_KernelPatch_patch e565c93 after 0001-fix-unload-lifetime.
SukiSU builtin 1cfa5734 no longer exports the seven legacy KPM stubs.
Backport the bridge framing/dispatcher from upstream 1c5b608916357ac86a94cc736e235db1fac4a29d,
retaining the legacy path and our callback/module lifetime implementation.
Use the existing module-list lock rather than an unmatched RCU reader.
Honor the new bounded LIST/INFO output contract and event-aware file loads.
This repairs the confirmed KPM ABI mismatch; it is not proof that the
separate first-screen boot failure has been resolved.

